**10.1 Tenant Noisy Neighbor Mitigation**

-   Per-tenant rate limiting at API Gateway --- configurable by
    subscription tier

-   Database query timeout enforcement --- long-running queries killed
    before they block others

-   Read replica routing for reporting --- heavy report queries routed
    to read replicas

-   Background job queue isolation --- a tenant\'s bulk export does not
    block real-time API responses

-   Circuit breaker pattern --- a failing integration for one tenant
    does not cascade to others

-   Option to migrate extremely high-volume tenants to dedicated
    database infrastructure

